<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="sidebar_hud.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="sidebar_hud">
    <!-- Tier 7 sidebar HUD (game::draw_panels). A PERSISTENT, render-only,
         continuous every-turn document — NOT a modal open/loop/close screen. It is
         opened once during gameplay and synced each turn; modal screens stack above
         it by open order. The body is transparent so the cleared (black) sidebar
         region shows through; only migrated panels paint. Slice 1 owns the Stats
         panel only — its row is built by hud_stats_text() + cata_text_to_rml() and
         bound to `stats_rml`. Further panels stack below as later slices land. -->
    <div id="hud-col" class="hud-col">
        <div class="hud-panel hud-stats" data-rml="stats_rml"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
